card.text:
When Cupid's Grenade enters, pluck red 2. Attach Cupid's Grenade to a creature you control. (If you control a red Pikmin Army, distribute 2 +1/+1 counters among Armies you control. They are also Pikmin. If you do not, create a 0/0 red Pikmin Army creature token with phantom and put 2 +1/+1 counters on it.)
Equipped creature has haste and menace.
Equip {1}{R}

When this Equipment enters, pluck red 1. Attach this Equipment to a creature you control. (If you control a red Pikmin Army, distribute 1 +1/+1 counters among Armies you control. They are also Pikmin. If you do not, create a 0/0 red Pikmin Army creature token with phantom and put 1 +1/+1 counters on it.)
Equipped creature gets +1/+0 and has flying.
Equip {1}{W}

Flying, ward {1}
Whenever this creature deals combat damage, you may pay 1 life. If you do, scrounge.
{2}, Sacrifice a Food: This creature gets +2/+0 and gains lifelink until end of turn.

Equipped creature gets +3/+3.
If equipped creature would be destroyed, instead remove all damage marked on it and sacrifice Triple Threat. 
Equip {3}

Ward {2}
When Dingo enters, you may search your library for a legendary card, reveal it, then shuffle and put that card on top.
Other legendary creatures you control get +1/+1.

When this Equipment enters, pluck white 2. A Pikmin Army token created this way gains flying. Attach this equipment to a creature you control.
Whenever equipped creature attacks, tap target creature defending player controls.
Equip {2}

When Telekinesis Detector enters, pluck red 2. Attach Telekinesis Detector to a creature you control. (If you control a red Pikmin Army, distribute 2 +1/+1 counters among Armies you control. They are also Pikmin. If you do not, create a 0/0 red Pikmin Army creature token with phantom and put 2 +1/+1 counters on it.)
Equipped creature gets +1/+0 and has hexproof.
Equip {1}{U}

When Unfloatable Boat enters, pluck red 3. Attach Unfloatable Boat to a creature you control. (If you control a red Pikmin Army, distribute 3 +1/+1 counters among Armies you control. They are also Pikmin. If you do not, create a 0/0 red Pikmin Army creature token with phantom and put 3 +1/+1 counters on it.)
Equipped creature gets +2/+2 and can't be blocked.
Equip {4}

When this Equipment enters, pluck red 4. Attach this Equipment to a creature you control.
Whenever equipped creature attacks, creatures you control get +2/+2 and gain menace until end of turn.
Equip {2}{R}

When this Equipment enters, pluck red 1. Attach this Equipment to a creature you control.
Equipped creature has "{1}, {T}: Create a Treasure token."
Equip {1}{R}

Equipped creature gets +2/+2 and has "Whenever this creature attacks, you gain 1 life for each attacking creature you control."
If you both own and control Bright Sword, its equip abilities cost {3} less to activate.
Equip {5}
